{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/9d77092f726e1942b38a7e524ca0349d.avif?t=1761845278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras_big/9d77092f726e1942b38a7e524ca0349d.avif?t=1761845278 width=800 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/93414315397cc2a21cd2857ec3c7ce5a.poster.avif?t=1761845278\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/93414315397cc2a21cd2857ec3c7ce5a.webm?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/93414315397cc2a21cd2857ec3c7ce5a.mp4?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned deep in the forest, <strong>Gretel &amp; Hansel</strong> must use every trick they know to survive the journey home. Along the way, they\u2019ll face devious puzzles, sinister creatures, and an all-seeing, ever-hungry witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/51f69f5ba5c08587c6d4094590cb581d.avif?t=1761845278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras_big/51f69f5ba5c08587c6d4094590cb581d.avif?t=1761845278 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/289ab7239e3789d6b4fa84604298d563.poster.avif?t=1761845278\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/289ab7239e3789d6b4fa84604298d563.webm?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/289ab7239e3789d6b4fa84604298d563.mp4?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gretel &amp; Hansel</i> \u201ctreats\u201d players to <strong>50+ uniquely animated deaths</strong>\u2014some absurd, others chilling. Dying isn\u2019t failure here\u2014it\u2019s part of the fun. In fact, death may reveal secrets, unlock treasures, or open new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/04acfdf6e7d936489a51388573fe0b05.avif?t=1761845278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras_big/04acfdf6e7d936489a51388573fe0b05.avif?t=1761845278 width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/817941aaa3ae3fe1754177a3b92aab54.poster.avif?t=1761845278\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/817941aaa3ae3fe1754177a3b92aab54.webm?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/817941aaa3ae3fe1754177a3b92aab54.mp4?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with Gretel\u2019s trusty <strong>slingshot</strong>, pointing and clicking becomes pointing and shooting.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break windows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pester squirrels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annoy your brother.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up something you <i>really</i> shouldn\u2019t have...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This highly interactive world rewards curiosity, mischief, and thinking outside the cauldron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/3b4b73a3a6747d7e76ee10aa4bc89fc5.avif?t=1761845278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras_big/3b4b73a3a6747d7e76ee10aa4bc89fc5.avif?t=1761845278 width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/4c1fc9c0373ee45e65788160b4ad0027.poster.avif?t=1761845278\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/4c1fc9c0373ee45e65788160b4ad0027.webm?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/4c1fc9c0373ee45e65788160b4ad0027.mp4?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted from <strong>hundreds of original watercolor paintings</strong>, every character, tree, shadow, and magic spell has been meticulously painted on paper and brought to life in a rich, 2.5D world. The result? A haunting storybook come to life\u2014equal parts beautiful and menacing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/425394d68dd72b5f1adba0e0a7a34190.avif?t=1761845278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras_big/425394d68dd72b5f1adba0e0a7a34190.avif?t=1761845278 width=1600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially released in 2009 and 2010, <i>Gretel &amp; Hansel Part 1 &amp; Part 2</i> were played over 4.7 million times and ranked #1 on Newgrounds upon release. Now, 15 years later, the twisted fairytale returns\u2014completely reimagined, fully hand-painted, and joined by the long-awaited <i>Part 3</i>. Get ready for the highly anticipated return of this fan favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/9242302b95502197fa4918e59e4460e0.avif?t=1761845278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras_big/9242302b95502197fa4918e59e4460e0.avif?t=1761845278 width=800 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Animated Deaths</strong> \u2013 Terrifying, hilarious, or both.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Costumes</strong> \u2013 Some grant special powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Slingshots </strong>\u2013 Fire, ice, fireworks, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Fairy Tokens</strong> \u2013 Unlock new secrets and extras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet a robot doggy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poke a bear!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your evil twin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuddle a bunny!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash a birthday party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a dance off!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/67dfef13c332494903c88331b5786a3c.poster.avif?t=1761845278\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/67dfef13c332494903c88331b5786a3c.webm?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299820?t=1761845278","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761845278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/e25f43be55871952dc3d4d97947ddcd319f3ec32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761845278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/e25f43be55871952dc3d4d97947ddcd319f3ec32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761845278","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game conta