\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/4c1fc9c0373ee45e65788160b4ad0027.mp4?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted from <strong>hundreds of original watercolor paintings</strong>, every character, tree, shadow, and magic spell has been meticulously painted on paper and brought to life in a rich, 2.5D world. The result? A haunting storybook come to life\u2014equal parts beautiful and menacing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/425394d68dd72b5f1adba0e0a7a34190.avif?t=1761845278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras_big/425394d68dd72b5f1adba0e0a7a34190.avif?t=1761845278 width=1600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially released in 2009 and 2010, <i>Gretel &amp; Hansel Part 1 &amp; Part 2</i> were played over 4.7 million times and ranked #1 on Newgrounds upon release. Now, 15 years later, the twisted fairytale returns\u2014completely reimagined, fully hand-painted, and joined by the long-awaited <i>Part 3</i>. Get ready for the highly anticipated return of this fan favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/9242302b95502197fa4918e59e4460e0.avif?t=1761845278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras_big/9242302b95502197fa4918e59e4460e0.avif?t=1761845278 width=800 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Animated Deaths</strong> \u2013 Terrifying, hilarious, or both.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Costumes</strong> \u2013 Some grant special powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Slingshots </strong>\u2013 Fire, ice, fireworks, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Fairy Tokens</strong> \u2013 Unlock new secrets and extras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet a robot doggy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poke a bear!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your evil twin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuddle a bunny!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash a birthday party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a dance off!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/67dfef13c332494903c88331b5786a3c.poster.avif?t=1761845278\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/67dfef13c332494903c88331b5786a3c.webm?t=1761845278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Spider House"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/17562a99a86c64e63cc429c366a149e0f4314954/header.jpg?t=1761845278","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Spider House Studios, LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+ / SteamOS 2.0+ (64-bit) o